                  Parameters for BACKTR
                  *********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
normal_scores.dat   \file with data
4   \column with Gaussian variable
-1.0e21 1.0e21   \trimming limits
backtr.out   \file for output
backtr_table.dat   \file with input transformation table
0 50   \minimum and maximum data value
1 1.0   \lower tail option and parameter
1 1.0   \upper tail option and parameter
